From: Devario maintainers
Subject: [PATCH] Prefer a GPU type without restricting display discovery

Backport the renderer preference and renderer-following client policy onto
Aqueous v1.0.5. Keep explicit overrides, fallback and GPU hotplug discovery.
The client-policy work is included because stale selectors in the released
version could otherwise filter Vulkan enumeration before applying a preference.

